there, the important variables for cgi-programs are marked in bold:

GATEWAY_INTERFACE=CGI/1.1
*GEMINI_URL*=gemini://h2903872.stratoserver.net/cgi-bin/man/env
*HOSTNAME*=h2903872.stratoserver.net
